# ── Third-party Zalo (VNG) content ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Olaz downloads the official Zalo PC runtime from VNG at first launch; none of
# VNG's files are redistributed here. Regenerate these locally from Zalo PC if
# you need them for reverse-engineering (see docs/REVERSE-ENGINEERING-NOTES.md).
docs/reanalysis/app_extracted/
docs/reanalysis/lang_vi.json
macos/Assets/zalo-logo.png
macos/Assets/zalo-wordmark.svg
macos/Assets/zalo.icns
macos/Assets/avatar-default.png
macos/Sources/Olaz/Resources/sg_emo.json
